{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.000.0010",
      "source_sha256": "4aaf899e104676ff",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But let us serve one another like Jesus, who took the form of a servant for our sake."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.000.0011",
      "source_sha256": "02f73f650eeb9880",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And like Paul, the servant of Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.000.0012",
      "source_sha256": "b71c5ac4db03a911",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And like all the apostles and all the prophets, who became servants of the Lord and his Christ, Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.000.0022",
      "source_sha256": "a6de8763de0235bf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not be afraid of those who will kill your body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.001.0006",
      "source_sha256": "6d88c49e758e0d98",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] is [?], [?] after his [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.001.0021",
      "source_sha256": "ac4e567ca50ca376",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Isaac was praying to the Lord, wanting to have children by Rebekah."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.002.0001",
      "source_sha256": "46985072d732c66f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If some among us initially refuse, with quarrelling and disobedience, tasks that they are able to attend to,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.002.0008",
      "source_sha256": "14727e8d2454c2b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And if Sarah and Rebekah and Rachel and Hannah and the mother of the prophet Samson and Elizabeth, the mother of John, who was filled with the Holy Spirit while still in his mother's womb,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.002.0011",
      "source_sha256": "846bc66e0af95456",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For from the beginning until now, there have been many parents whom God has put to shame, whether men or women,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.002.0020",
      "source_sha256": "8203c6d5effdf573",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because they preferred to suffer with others through God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.002.0036",
      "source_sha256": "b6b2c08fde4598cf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Just as he, too, did not seek his own benefit, but that of many."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.002.0050",
      "source_sha256": "3eeca70552a3d110",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of the calling with which he called them into this life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.003.0000",
      "source_sha256": "1cacb82bb70cc5be",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "not letting him repay those who kill them and flog them, as they drag them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.003.0007",
      "source_sha256": "5106de7d6b872f8c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For he is our Savior; he is our Lord and our Father."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.003.0022",
      "source_sha256": "4ca77e2d5a012c68",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“It was not you,” he said, “who chose me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.003.0027",
      "source_sha256": "804b9ea3036656a8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If they kept my word, they will also keep yours."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.004.0007",
      "source_sha256": "ed1e5dc6308309c0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But if disobedient and sinful children were born to our ancestors,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.004.0028",
      "source_sha256": "ce1e23aae71491ec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and they did not spare Abraham's descendants when they sinned before God, who created them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.004.0030",
      "source_sha256": "b1887172b550874f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "according to everything written in the law of Moses."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.004.0032",
      "source_sha256": "81ad819ab2981268",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Still more, they cursed every false prophet, all the priests who lead people astray, and every antichrist."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.005.0004",
      "source_sha256": "7642aa1d8ffc76fd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "whether through impurity and defilement, or through theft and deceit, or through hatred and insolence, or through hypocrisy and empty glory."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.005.0005",
      "source_sha256": "77111c1d1c460637",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Who are the insolent people, if not those who grumble"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.005.0006",
      "source_sha256": "a08d87c739bf0bf6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and shake their heads with great irritation and roll their eyes at those who guide them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.005.0007",
      "source_sha256": "fef84d242fa715e9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who care for them and teach them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.005.0008",
      "source_sha256": "da4d07f825b72949",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to live in good order according to all God's ordinances."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.005.0031",
      "source_sha256": "4c6e3815dfefb204",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "“I refused because I cannot do this.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.005.0032",
      "source_sha256": "132cac31c8f55e47",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "And after some days, or after some time, if we hear that she refused out of contentiousness, you will all know what you are to do to her."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.006.0012",
      "source_sha256": "8bf8f828f2809e6c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "People like these are the ones who will be able to become disciples of the Lord according to the Scriptures."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.006.0017",
      "source_sha256": "c5c5a83516a5559f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Our holy fathers, the prophets and the apostles, are people of this kind."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.006.0027",
      "source_sha256": "a4128b7ab7078b65",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "[?] wise children would not want to do the things their righteous father does?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.006.0028",
      "source_sha256": "4eaaae72f67d43d2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "What wise brothers would not follow the example of their faithful brothers who are greater than they are?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.006.0029",
      "source_sha256": "0fc3e724b83cf8cd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "That is, what wise people would not want to do the deeds that their Father in heaven does,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.006.0030",
      "source_sha256": "1615be3e42c88f2f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "that is, God and our Lord Jesus,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.006.0031",
      "source_sha256": "cfe32ede72ea620d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "and follow the example of the Lord’s angels, the example of the prophets, and the example of Paul and all the apostles, who said"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/abraham#CopScr.abraham.006.0035",
      "source_sha256": "88b583094301b203",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "again, “You shall make yourself an example in everything.”"
    }
  ]
}
